{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32129","headline":"照影曲 · 温庭筠","name":"照影曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"景阳妆罢琼牕暖，欲照澄明香步嬾。\n桥上衣多抱彩云，金鳞不动春塘满。\n黄印额山轻爲尘，翠鳞红穉俱含嚬。\n桃花百媚如欲语，曾爲无双今两身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32129.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32129","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}